{"unit_id": "tag:01SA:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。存在如下反变的范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>概形（Schemes），仿射（affine）<MATHSEG_0002>于<MATHSEG_0003>拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）<MATHSEG_0004>由<MATHSEG_0005>-代数（algebras）构成<MATHSEG_0006>\n它将<MATH_0002>对应到层（sheaf）<MATH_0003>。\n此外，此等价（equivalence）与任意基变换（base change）相容。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "引理陈述的反变范畴关系。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "等价左侧所列的对象。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "限定左侧概形相对于给定概形的性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "等价右侧所列的对象。"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数", "context": "指定右侧拟凝聚层所带的代数结构。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "指明该对应所得的对象。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价", "context": "末句回指前述反变范畴等价。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "末句陈述该等价与任意此类操作相容。"}], "notes": []}
